[
  {
    "act": "signal",
    "start": 1,
    "end": 3.8385833333333332,
    "duration": 2.8385833333333332,
    "file": "production/voice/80152361eb6515ff2bac.wav",
    "text": "以前，你给人工智能一句话，它回你一段话。"
  },
  {
    "act": "signal",
    "start": 4.418583333333333,
    "end": 8.048333333333334,
    "duration": 3.62975,
    "file": "production/voice/96d314ff1b449c947822.wav",
    "text": "现在，你给它一个目标，它开始调用工具，检查结果。"
  },
  {
    "act": "signal",
    "start": 8.628333333333334,
    "end": 10.101708333333335,
    "duration": 1.473375,
    "file": "production/voice/2d800f1f744021c6f53c.wav",
    "text": "语言，正在变成行动。"
  },
  {
    "act": "rules",
    "start": 17,
    "end": 20.490791666666667,
    "duration": 3.4907916666666665,
    "file": "production/voice/40c3757029cacd31d6f6.wav",
    "text": "最早的一类聊天程序，靠关键词触发写好的回答。"
  },
  {
    "act": "rules",
    "start": 21.070791666666665,
    "end": 24.57933333333333,
    "duration": 3.5085416666666664,
    "file": "production/voice/5cd54f3c696f89c66fec.wav",
    "text": "命中规则，就沿着轨道走；换一种说法，就可能卡住。"
  },
  {
    "act": "rules",
    "start": 25.15933333333333,
    "end": 28.215999999999994,
    "duration": 3.0566666666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/5048ec9c994188abc790.wav",
    "text": "于是，人们换了一个思路：不再把每条规则写死。"
  },
  {
    "act": "rules",
    "start": 28.795999999999992,
    "end": 32.16516666666666,
    "duration": 3.3691666666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/96ffa244982f96cc7ec7.wav",
    "text": "而是给机器大量例子，让它自己调整内部参数。"
  },
  {
    "act": "learn",
    "start": 37,
    "end": 40.891625,
    "duration": 3.891625,
    "file": "production/voice/fd149de110ab6b16cf14.wav",
    "text": "神经网络把输入变成数字，让信号穿过一层层连接。"
  },
  {
    "act": "learn",
    "start": 41.471624999999996,
    "end": 44.61725,
    "duration": 3.145625,
    "file": "production/voice/59727d2304010502ce58.wav",
    "text": "先预测，再比较答案；误差沿网络反向传播。"
  },
  {
    "act": "learn",
    "start": 45.19725,
    "end": 49.358374999999995,
    "duration": 4.161125,
    "file": "production/voice/d5ad475dc6237c4b5b29.wav",
    "text": "每次更新，都微调连接的权重，让下一次预测更接近目标。"
  },
  {
    "act": "learn",
    "start": 49.93837499999999,
    "end": 54.05687499999999,
    "duration": 4.1185,
    "file": "production/voice/6909b415a571498c37b3.wav",
    "text": "更多数据、更强算力和更好的方法，让网络学到复杂规律。"
  },
  {
    "act": "learn",
    "start": 54.63687499999999,
    "end": 58.72754166666665,
    "duration": 4.0906666666666665,
    "file": "production/voice/f84fb7ac11580c67f3a7.wav",
    "text": "它不是把答案装进抽屉，而是在参数中形成可迁移的模式。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 63,
    "end": 65.828375,
    "duration": 2.828375,
    "file": "production/voice/c3429bae7da00909c346.wav",
    "text": "真正改变语言模型的一步，是注意力机制。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 66.40837499999999,
    "end": 70.320375,
    "duration": 3.912,
    "file": "production/voice/341f27fa286ea0e4a20c.wav",
    "text": "一句话被拆成词元，转换为向量，再计算彼此的关联。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 70.900375,
    "end": 74.908625,
    "duration": 4.00825,
    "file": "production/voice/3163dc409b5e0ef128b8.wav",
    "text": "小猫追着光点跑，它很兴奋。这个它，更应该关注小猫。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 75.488625,
    "end": 80.215875,
    "duration": 4.72725,
    "file": "production/voice/0034ce9a2fc26c584318.wav",
    "text": "二零一七年的注意力架构，让这种关联计算更容易大规模并行训练。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 80.795875,
    "end": 84.62120833333333,
    "duration": 3.8253333333333335,
    "file": "production/voice/5a7366cc7637deaa5771.wav",
    "text": "生成时，模型根据已有上下文，预测下一个词元的概率。"
  },
  {
    "act": "attention",
    "start": 85.20120833333333,
    "end": 89.57595833333333,
    "duration": 4.37475,
    "file": "production/voice/26ff3d9c0827bad18a63.wav",
    "text": "选出一个，接回上下文，再预测下一个，语言就这样逐步展开。"
  },
  {
    "act": "scale",
    "start": 93,
    "end": 95.0195,
    "duration": 2.0195,
    "file": "production/voice/bdee8ae727abc98ec794.wav",
    "text": "但会续写，不等于会帮助人。"
  },
  {
    "act": "scale",
    "start": 95.59949999999999,
    "end": 100.22529166666666,
    "duration": 4.625791666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/0a1ba68cc4eb948267fd.wav",
    "text": "预训练从大量文本和代码中学习规律；指令微调，示范怎样回答。"
  },
  {
    "act": "scale",
    "start": 100.80529166666666,
    "end": 104.38137499999999,
    "duration": 3.5760833333333335,
    "file": "production/voice/e64ba67ec835b4de53aa.wav",
    "text": "人类偏好和可验证反馈，再推动模型变得更有用。"
  },
  {
    "act": "scale",
    "start": 104.96137499999999,
    "end": 109.698,
    "duration": 4.736625,
    "file": "production/voice/3c987250ba1f954f02da.wav",
    "text": "进步不是只把模型做大，还来自数据质量、训练方法和系统工程。"
  },
  {
    "act": "scale",
    "start": 110.27799999999999,
    "end": 114.58729166666666,
    "duration": 4.309291666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/bec55444f7881a058bf8.wav",
    "text": "这些过程改变参数，不代表你每问一句，它就现场重新训练。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 117,
    "end": 119.25991666666667,
    "duration": 2.259916666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/b336d7ce5d6aad52b7cf.wav",
    "text": "接着，模型不再总是立刻给出答案。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 119.83991666666667,
    "end": 124.97233333333334,
    "duration": 5.132416666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/a86d2f58904b40920dbc.wav",
    "text": "通过专门训练和更多推理计算，它可以分解问题，尝试路线，再检查。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 125.55233333333334,
    "end": 128.774,
    "duration": 3.2216666666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/10e1fee558874183a1f7.wav",
    "text": "失败的路径被放弃，有证据的路径继续向前。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 129.354,
    "end": 132.95450000000002,
    "duration": 3.6005,
    "file": "production/voice/d56be256137dc5751e65.wav",
    "text": "图像、声音与文字，也被编码成可以共同处理的表示。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 133.53450000000004,
    "end": 136.54608333333337,
    "duration": 3.0115833333333333,
    "file": "production/voice/1745f337065c7fe0d54f.wav",
    "text": "它能看图、听声音、理解更复杂的上下文。"
  },
  {
    "act": "reason",
    "start": 137.12608333333338,
    "end": 140.85962500000005,
    "duration": 3.7335416666666665,
    "file": "production/voice/5320e43f906492397d54.wav",
    "text": "但说得流畅，仍然不等于正确，检查结果至关重要。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 143,
    "end": 146.70479166666667,
    "duration": 3.7047916666666665,
    "file": "production/voice/b9b0733f59a14d626a3f.wav",
    "text": "智能体，往前又走了一步：把模型接入能够行动的环境。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 147.28479166666668,
    "end": 149.473,
    "duration": 2.1882083333333333,
    "file": "production/voice/37c284057c47b792c3f4.wav",
    "text": "比如，你让它把一个想法做成网站。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 150.05300000000003,
    "end": 153.9257916666667,
    "duration": 3.8727916666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/51fb063ea946ebbcbb1d.wav",
    "text": "它先拆解目标，读取资料，然后调用工具，编辑文件。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 154.5057916666667,
    "end": 159.1946666666667,
    "duration": 4.688875,
    "file": "production/voice/430c89617efd3943470f.wav",
    "text": "工具返回真实结果，模型据此决定下一步，而不是假装已经完成。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 159.77466666666672,
    "end": 162.3623333333334,
    "duration": 2.587666666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/eb61ce7f73719f9fee45.wav",
    "text": "测试失败了？读错误，改代码，再运行。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 162.9423333333334,
    "end": 167.83004166666674,
    "duration": 4.887708333333333,
    "file": "production/voice/f115a0aa07a93e5a0289.wav",
    "text": "观察、计划、执行、验证，这个循环，让一次回答变成持续推进的任务。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 168.41004166666676,
    "end": 173.32600000000008,
    "duration": 4.915958333333333,
    "file": "production/voice/c1f10f8fd767ac81692b.wav",
    "text": "记忆和检索保留必要信息；权限、预算和停止条件，限制行动范围。"
  },
  {
    "act": "agent",
    "start": 173.9060000000001,
    "end": 176.64670833333344,
    "duration": 2.7407083333333335,
    "file": "production/voice/bd276f36768c065bb8f6.wav",
    "text": "能自主推进，不等于可以绕过人的授权。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 181,
    "end": 183.98225,
    "duration": 2.98225,
    "file": "production/voice/5b176d219c68259f77a2.wav",
    "text": "现在，看看不同顶尖系统已经展示的能力。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 184.56225,
    "end": 186.76862500000001,
    "duration": 2.206375,
    "file": "production/voice/599b2c67425c3fedfd0a.wav",
    "text": "编写软件，检索研究，分析数据。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 187.34862500000003,
    "end": 189.45762500000004,
    "duration": 2.109,
    "file": "production/voice/85680db5b2d89e2d9182.wav",
    "text": "生成图像、视频、声音和音乐。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 190.03762500000005,
    "end": 192.3074166666667,
    "duration": 2.269791666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/4770ac1241e913e72c3f.wav",
    "text": "辅助数学探索，设计更好的算法。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 192.88741666666672,
    "end": 195.2794583333334,
    "duration": 2.3920416666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/ad4d040f6b2bcf7accbb.wav",
    "text": "预测蛋白质结构，推演全球天气。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 195.8594583333334,
    "end": 198.6693750000001,
    "duration": 2.8099166666666666,
    "file": "production/voice/d4aa41b025b0005fc13a.wav",
    "text": "看懂环境，控制机器人，操作数字工具。"
  },
  {
    "act": "frontier",
    "start": 199.2493750000001,
    "end": 202.5417500000001,
    "duration": 3.292375,
    "file": "production/voice/1f0176d102f58a9de7c7.wav",
    "text": "这些能力来自不同系统，并非一款模型无所不能。"
  },
  {
    "act": "outro",
    "start": 207.35,
    "end": 209.6374583333333,
    "duration": 2.2874583333333334,
    "file": "production/voice/689e9e0690747d89a371.wav",
    "text": "从接住一句话，到推进一个目标。"
  },
  {
    "act": "outro",
    "start": 210.21745833333333,
    "end": 212.36825,
    "duration": 2.1507916666666667,
    "file": "production/voice/d601c0e06c0ddaa46f72.wav",
    "text": "下一次，你准备让它，创造什么？"
  }
]